  "title": "Personalized Blonde Girl Reading Amidst Bookshelves Blanket - Book",
  "handle": "personalized-blonde-girl-reading-amidst-bookshelves-blanket-book",
  "body_html": "<p>Immerse yourself in comfort with this personalized Jeminise blanket, a truly unique and thoughtful gift for any book lover. Celebrate their passion for reading with a cozy throw that can be customized with special details, making it a one-of-a-kind treasure.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Book Lovers:</strong> A thoughtful and personal present that celebrates their love of reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize with details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name to create a truly unique blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect Gift Idea:</strong> Ideal for birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for any reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any reading nook.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
